Description: RoboParty unified web backend server
 FastAPI + WebSocket server providing the roboparty.v1 protobuf
 protocol for gamepad, Android app, head unit, MCP, and backpack
 clients. Streams IMU, battery, motor errors and manages policy
 execution. Runs on the RK3588 robot controller.
